{
  "key": 8405,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name’s Cheryl.\n",
        "And you are...?\r",
        "OK, so your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’m sincerely glad to meet you.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, may I ask a big favor\n",
        "of you?\r",
        "I want to get through this forest,\n",
        "but I’m afraid of doing it alone.\r",
        "I’ve heard that there is a sinister\n",
        "group of people called Team Galactic\\fabout.\r",
        "I think there’d be safety in numbers.\n",
        "Please, may I go through with you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} decided to go with\n",
        "Cheryl!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: I’ll keep your Pokémon\n",
        "in perfect health."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh, hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve been waiting like I said.\r",
        "Let’s get through this forest\n",
        "together.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh? Are you going back?\n",
        "I’ll wait here for you, then.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh! There’s the exit!\n",
        "I’m so relieved... We finally got here.\r",
        "I would’ve never been able to get\n",
        "through this by myself.\r",
        "Thank you so much, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sure we’ll meet again somewhere!\n",
        "Bye for now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon got poisoned, and now\n",
        "it can’t battle.\r",
        "I knew I should’ve loaded up on\n",
        "Antidotes at the Poké Mart!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The rock is covered in moss.\n",
        "It feels pleasantly cool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Gardenia: Hiya! Were you intrigued\n",
        "by the rumors going around, too?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "You know, people’ve been talking\n",
        "about the ghost Pokémon of the Old\\fChateau.\r",
        "I’ve been hearing rumors about\n",
        "sinister shadows, too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I should check it out myself, but\n",
        "going in there is...\r",
        "...Well, you know, being that I’m\n",
        "a Gym Leader, I’m always busy.\r",
        "So, since I’m so busy, I can’t go in.\n",
        "It’s not because I’m s-scared!\r",
        "S-so, good luck with your\n",
        "investigation!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Eterna Forest\n",
        "Where Time Stands Still"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0934_SD03R0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips!\r",
        "In forests and caves, there are many\n",
        "items on the ground that cannot be\\fseen in the murky darkness.\r",
        "Take the time to search carefully!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}